Figure 3 shows the CaptionFuse pipeline.
Given a reference product image I r I_{r} and text modification t t , CaptionFuse (Algorithm 1 ):
(1) classifies query type τ ∈ { Text_Image , Image_Only } \tau\in\{\textsc{Text\_Image},\textsc{Image\_Only}\} via a rule-based classifier;
(2) generates a product-title caption c c via VLM;
(3) encodes I r I_{r} and c c ;
(4) fuses with fixed weights ( α = 0.15 \alpha{=}0.15 ).

